  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3202.20 “Rake” means the angle, measured in degrees, of a motorcycle's steering axis in relation to a line which is perpendicular to the motorcycle’s wheelbase.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes at Chapter Heading Saf-C 3200) #8915, eff 6-22-07, EXPIRED: 6-22-15\n\nNew. #10886, INTERIM, eff 7-16-15, EXPIRES: 1-12-16; ss by #11016, eff 1-6-16 (from Saf-C 3202.14); renumbered by #12196 (from Saf-C 3202.18); renumbered by #13920 (formerly Saf-C 3202.19)",
